OL,5,MCISKEI TROOPS SHOOT DEAD ANC PROTESTERS
OL,7, 114FAt least 23 killed and 147 injured
OL,8, 115FSouth Africa not involved: de Klerk
OL,10, 104 MAASTRICHTFGood for Britain - Major
OL,12, 103 BOSNIAFNew talks on relief flights
OL,14, 112 TAJIKISTANFPresident Nabiyev quits
OL,15,F
