PN,11807
SC,0007
CT,25,T
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F118A1788802432
OL,1,Vk4                               G7/20
OL,2,Vj5{5jj5~sGRELIEF PLANE SAFETY TO
OL,3,Vj5op0ozz5pGBE DISCUSSED
OL,4,D
OL,5, United Nations and European Community
OL,6, envoys have invited all parties in the
OL,7, Bosnian conflict to attend talks on
OL,8, security guarantees for relief planes.
OL,9,F
OL,10,FThe invitation follows a meeting in
OL,11,FGeneva to find ways of increasing
OL,12,Fsecurity for aid planes over Bosnia.
OL,13,F
OL,14,FAid flights were suspended last week
OL,15,Fafter an Italian air force plane was
OL,16,Fapparently shot down. UN military
OL,17,Fflights were stopped this morning.
OL,18,F
OL,19,FBosnian police said 26 people were
OL,20,Fkilled and 170 others injured across
OL,21,FBosnia in the 24 hours up ho midday.
OL,23,D]FFromG07-09-92F  teletextarchive.com
OL,24,ANext PageBT'text FilesCRewindFReg Radio
