OL,1,Vk4                               G9/20
OL,2,Vj5{5jj5~sGULSTER VOLUNTEER FORCE
OL,3,Vj5op0ozz5pGSHOT COUPLE
OL,5, The Ulster Volunteer Force says it shot
OL,6, dead an elderly Catholic couple this
OL,7, morning in County Tyrone.
OL,8,F
OL,9,FTheir daughters found the bodies of
OL,10,FCharles Fox, 63, and his wife Theresa,
OL,11,F53, at their home near Moy.
OL,12,F
OL,13,FThe Ulster Unionist MP, Ken Maginnis,
OL,14,Fsaid the murder was "totally
OL,15,Funforgivable".
OL,16,F
OL,17,FLast week one of the couple's sons was
OL,18,Fjailed on explosives charges. In
OL,19,FJanuary their son-in-law and his uncle
OL,20,Fdied after a UVF shooting at their
OL,21,Fbutcher's shop in Moy.
OL,23,D]FFromG07-09-92F  teletextarchive.com
OL,24,ANext PageBT'text FilesCRewindFReg Radio
